# Copy to `.dev.vars` (gitignored) for local `wrangler dev`. Literal values only. Never commit the
# filled-in copy. NS_SERVER and the two ACCESS_* values belong in wrangler.jsonc `vars`, not here —
# keep each key in exactly one place rather than relying on which one wins.

# The stored credential this Worker reads NetSapiens as. It answers EVERY request that reaches the
# Worker, so use the narrowest token your platform will issue — read-only if that is on offer.
NS_API_KEY=""

# Optional: softphone app presence on diagram agent lines. Blank ⇒ no app calls at all, and the
# diagram is byte-identical to the NetSapiens-only baseline.
RINGOTEL_API_KEY=""
